<title>JAPAN: Japan Jan department store sales up 0.5 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Jan department store sales up 0.5 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales at Japanese department stores in January rose 0.5 percent from a year earlier to 706.15 billion yen, the Japan Department Stores' Association said on Monday.  </p>
<p>Sales were active at the beginning of January but they slowed towards the end of the month, the association said in a statement.</p>
<p>The year-on-year rise in January followed a large increase in sales in January last year, it said.</p>
</text>
